senses.gloss:
पितृव्य, अस्, m. a father's brother, paternal uncle;
any elderly male relation; [cf. Gr. πάτρω-ς; Lat.
patruus.]

पीतक, अस्, इका, अम्, of a yellow colour, yellow;
(अस्), m. a species of gentian, Gentiana Cherayta; the
Tūn tree, Cedrela Toona; (इका), f. saffron; turmeric;
yellow jasmine; (अम्), n. yellow orpiment; brass;
honey; saffron; yellow sandal; aloe wood, Amyris
[]
Agallocha; a species of Śyonāka; = पीत-शाल.
—पीतक-द्रुम, अस्, m. Curcuma Xanthorrhiza
(= हरि-द्रु).

पीतन, अस्, m. the hog-plum, Spondias Mangifera;
a tree, Pentaptera Tomentosa; the waved-leaf fig-
tree, Ficus Infectoria; (अम्), n. yellow orpiment;
saffron; a species of pine (= देव-दारु).
